An integer string value is coerced to an int and written unquoted in the frontmatter.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: My Plan
---
# My Plan
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md count=42
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
 ---
 title: My Plan
+count: 42
 ---
 # My Plan
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: count=42
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: My Plan
count: 42
---
# My Plan
